1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"phase-7--7a-domain-domination","kind":"phase-article","route":"/roadmap/phase-7/7a-domain-domination","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/phase-7/7a-domain-domination","sourceHash":"763da1416bed7a0bd39dbc7c3b29fe993dd1ec034adc46efe397acae8f58f98c","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:12:06.922Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"7A — Domain Domination","zh":"7A——领域精通"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"what-youre-doing","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"What You're Doing","zh":"你正在做什么"}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"You're functionally fluent, but your fluency is still probably concentrated in familiar domains — everyday conversation, the genres of media you've consumed, and the topics you've discussed with partners. Step outside those areas and you'll hit walls: technical vocabulary you don't know, jargon you've never encountered, writing styles you haven't read.","zh":"你已经具备实际使用上的流利度，但你的流利程度可能仍集中在熟悉的领域——日常对话、你接触过的媒体类型，以及你和语伴讨论过的话题。一旦走出这些范围，你就会遇到障碍：不认识的技术词汇、从未接触过的术语、没有读过的写作风格。"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"This sub-phase is about choosing specific domains and becoming genuinely proficient in them. Maybe it's your professional field, a hobby, an academic subject, or a genre of literature. The goal is to go deep enough that you can read, discuss, and write about these topics with the same fluency you have in everyday conversation.","zh":"这一子阶段的目标是选择特定领域，并真正掌握它们。可以是你的职业领域、某项爱好、某个学术科目，或某种文学类型。目标是深入到足以让你以日常对话般的流利程度阅读、讨论和写作这些主题。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Think about your goal as \"becoming more interesting to talk to in the language.\"","zh":"把你的目标想成“让自己变成一个更有趣的语言交流对象”。"}},{"id":"whats-new","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"What's New","zh":"有什么新内容"}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Nothing is really new in this phase. You've done it all! You should continue to use all the skills and techniques you've learned throughout your journey to constantly improve. The only thing to specifically call out is:","zh":"这一阶段其实没有什么新内容。你已经全都做过了！你应继续运用整个学习旅程中掌握的所有技能和技巧，不断提升自己。唯一需要特别指出的是："}},{"id":"segment-0007","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Domain-focused immersion</strong> — Choose a few new, specific domains and immerse in them intensively. Read articles, books, and technical writing. Watch lectures, documentaries, and expert discussions. The vocabulary and structures of each domain are specific enough that you'll need dedicated time to learn them, but they build quickly once you start. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/domains\">Domains</a>","zh":"<strong>领域专注式沉浸</strong>——选择几个新的具体领域，集中进行高强度沉浸。阅读文章、书籍和技术写作；观看讲座、纪录片和专家讨论。每个领域的词汇和结构都足够具体，需要专门投入时间学习，但一旦开始，它们就会迅速积累。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/domains\">领域</a>"}},{"id":"your-routine","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Your Routine","zh":"你的日常安排"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Heavy on input, with targeted output. Freeflow and interactive have basically become the same thing at this point. You never need to look up more than a few works per minute:","zh":"以输入为主，并进行有针对性的输出。到这个阶段，自由流式沉浸和互动式沉浸基本已经融为一体。你每分钟需要查的词不会超过几个："}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"<strong>Priming:</strong> 20%","zh":"<strong>预热：</strong>20%"},{"en":"<strong>Interactive/Freeflow Immersion:</strong> 60%","zh":"<strong>互动式/自由流式沉浸：</strong>60%"},{"en":"<strong>Output:</strong> 20%","zh":"<strong>输出：</strong>20%"}]},{"id":"sample-daily-schedule","type":"heading","level":3,"content":{"en":"Sample Daily Schedule","zh":"每日安排示例"}},{"id":"segment-0012","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Vocab study: 20 mins","zh":"词汇学习：20分钟"},{"en":"Sentence Mining from chosen domains: 60 mins","zh":"从所选领域进行句子挖掘：60分钟"},{"en":"Speaking with Partner or Topic Writing: 20 mins","zh":"与语伴交流或进行主题写作：20分钟"}]},{"id":"when-to-move-on","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Move On","zh":"何时进入下一阶段"}},{"id":"segment-0014","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Move to 7B when you:","zh":"当你满足以下条件时，进入7B："}},{"id":"segment-0015","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Know 9000+ words","zh":"掌握9000个以上词汇"},{"en":"Can understand and engage meaningfully in a wide range of topics","zh":"能够理解广泛主题，并在其中进行有意义的交流"},{"en":"Feel comfortable learning new domains","zh":"能够自在地学习新的领域"}]}],"cards":[]}}]
